---
// The notice on every docs page: nothing here is cleared for use yet.
---
<div class="dz-notice" role="note" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <p><b>Still in active development.</b> doze, doze AWS and doze Kafka are not cleared for use yet. Expect breaking changes, and do not rely on them for real work.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .dz-notice { background: #fde7c8; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0c98f; color: #2a1534; }
  .dz-notice p { box-sizing: content-box; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 10px 32px; font: 400 14px/1.45 var(--font-text); }
  .dz-notice b { font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .dz-notice p { padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 13px; } }
  @media print { .dz-notice { display: none; } }
</style>
